                "text": "<p><span style=\"font-size:3em;\"><strong>Anne Brontë (1820-1849) - Écrivaine anglaise</strong></span></p>\n\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size:1.5em;\">INFORMATIONS UND EXERCISES</span></strong></p>\n"
